 forex trading Bot


A fast and intelligent forex trading bot that uses **Fair Value Gaps (FVG)** and **RSI** for 5-minute scalping.

##Features

- ✅ FVG detection and confirmation logic
- ✅ RSI filtering to improve trade accuracy
- ✅ Auto trade execution via Binance API
- ✅ Clean logging and optional GUI with tkinter



Setup

git clone https://github.com/hussainsarwari/final-version-forex-bot.git
cd crypto-scalping-bot
pip install -r requirements.txt
